{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14103080","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103080","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1410308001:0":{"text":"你们几个，站住。我乃因度厄，艾塞勒一族的卫队长。","source_cn":"你们几个，站住。我乃因度厄，艾塞勒一族的卫队长。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84BFB6506CD03604","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410308002:1":{"text":"你们参与了对孽化者的处理，此事涉及我族秘辛，我不能放你们走。","source_cn":"你们参与了对孽化者的处理，此事涉及我族秘辛，我不能放你们走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20B9E7E5BC9FCB94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410308003:1":{"text":"你说的秘辛，是指那孩子在我们眼前变成了怪物？","source_cn":"你说的秘辛，是指那孩子在我们眼前变成了怪物？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43AAB08EC0660485","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410308004:0":{"text":"我曾见过那种怪物，我还以为是什么稀有的地下物种。难道……他们原本都是你们……是艾塞勒？","source_cn":"我曾见过那种怪物，我还以为是什么稀有的地下物种。难道…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93AE50893B5CE8FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410308005:1":{"text":"……我不便透露。但你们牵涉到了其中——","source_cn":"……我不便透露。但你们牵涉到了其中——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5EDD985C7A5E93E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410308006:1":{"text":"必须随我去<style=\"highlight\">萨洛克兰</style>觐见祭司冕下，由她来定夺。","source_cn":"必须随我去<style=highlight>萨洛克兰<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDB0A7B93A0A3AE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410308007:1":{"text":"这么可疑的要求，我们才不会跟你走！","source_cn":"这么可疑的要求，我们才不会跟你走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38D338E3298A045C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410308008:1":{"text":"不要让事情变得复杂，我不想动手。","source_cn":"不要让事情变得复杂，我不想动手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2920BA75B502804A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410308009:0":{"text":"喂，你什么口气啊……我们这里可是有4个人！","source_cn":"喂，你什么口气啊……我们这里可是有4个人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68339A908C9D5072","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410308010:1":{"text":"所以你们选择用武力解决问题？","source_cn":"所以你们选择用武力解决问题？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7988509E87453554","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410308011:1":{"text":"停——这位小哥，你刚才说，要带我们去<style=\"highlight\">萨洛克兰</style>？"