,"document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:31:1410308023":{"text":"你们之间的关系，还有我们掉落下来这一系列事情，如果不解释清楚，我们很难相信你！","source_cn":"你们之间的关系，还有我们掉落下来这一系列事情，如果不解释清楚，我们很难相信你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD7FEE47785B99DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1410308024:0":{"text":"耀光来的？地表上那群矮人到底做了什么啊？","source_cn":"耀光来的？地表上那群矮人到底做了什么啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1210A06C9F941615","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1410308025:0":{"text":"怎么把你们惹过来了？","source_cn":"怎么把你们惹过来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x430897195E6678F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410308027:0":{"text":"总之，我先保证，一切跟你们想的都不一样！有些东西我不能告诉你们，但这事可以直说！","source_cn":"总之，我先保证，一切跟你们想的都不一样！有些东西我不能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF12037713F9413E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1410308028:1":{"text":"萨洛克兰，艾塞勒生活的那座王城，是我的同胞们所建。","source_cn":"萨洛克兰，艾塞勒生活的那座王城，是我的同胞们所建。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45927F077BB143A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1410308029:1":{"text":"哎？竟然是矮人建的吗？你们两个族群的关系这么密切